{"t":"Quirefang","s":"quirefang-992a7","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Winter_2011_Teaser_2_Image_1_965bed.png","q":6,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Quirefang</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"map\">\n<img alt=\"Winter 2011 Teaser 2 Image 1\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"197\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Winter_2011_Teaser_2_Image_1_965bed.png\" width=\"270\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruled by</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Old%20Rock%20Boy\">Old Rock Boy</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"organization\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Organizations</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"near\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Nearby places</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gray%20Beach\">Gray Beach</a>, East of <a href=\"#/wiki/Zao\">Zao</a>.</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Local</caption>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Hunting Places</th>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Quests</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Ancestorial%20Grounds\">Ancient Ancestorial Grounds</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Claustrophobic%20Inferno\">Claustrophobic Inferno</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ebb%20and%20Flow\">Ebb and Flow</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mirrored%20Nightmare\">Mirrored Nightmare</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Netherworld\">Netherworld</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Percht%20Island\">Percht Island</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rotten%20Wasteland\">Rotten Wasteland</a></li></ul></div></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/quest/deeplings-world-change\">Deeplings World Change</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/hive-born-world-change\">Hive Born World Change</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/insectoid-outfits-quest\">Insectoid Outfits Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/liquid-black-quest\">Liquid Black Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/war-against-the-hive-quest\">War Against the Hive Quest</a></li></ul></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">9.40<br/>December 14, 2011<br/>Winter Update 2011</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Locations <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>This area was implemented in the Winter Update 2011. Quirefang is a large island where two races are fighting for supremacy. It is only accessible through the <a href=\"#/wiki/Gray%20Island\">Gray Island</a>, a small isle to the west of <a href=\"#/wiki/Cormaya\">Cormaya</a>, that can only be reached by the eastern harbours. Once one arrives on the <a href=\"#/wiki/Gray%20Beach\">Gray Beach</a>, a small town located on the southern part of the island, they may find a <a href=\"#/wiki/Depot\">Depot</a>, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Temple\">Temple</a> and some Rockboys. To the north, there is the <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Hive\">Hive</a> a land of insectoids known as the <a href=\"#/wiki/Hive%20Born\">Hive Born</a>. In the depths below Quirefang one can find <a href=\"#/wiki/Fiehonja\">Fiehonja</a>, where the <a href=\"#/wiki/Deeplings\">Deeplings</a> reside. \n</p><p>There are two quests here called the <a href=\"#/quest/liquid-black-quest\">Liquid Black Quest</a> and <a href=\"#/quest/war-against-the-hive-quest\">War Against The Hive Quest</a>.\n</p></div>","quests":["20-years-a-cook-quest","hive-born-world-change","hive-outpost-mini-world-change","insectoid-outfits-quest","liquid-black-quest","war-against-the-hive-quest"]}